SUMMARY:Cultural Collab
LOCATION:Images Cinema\, 50 Spring St\, Williamstown\, MA 01267
DESCRIPTION:The Williamstown Cultural District and Images Lounge present Cu
 ltural Collab\, a monthly artist meetup on the last Monday of each month\,
  7 - 9pm. At each meetup three artists will briefly present their work\, f
 ollowed by conversation and social time. Hosted by artist Julie Henderson.
  Snacks will be provided\; drinks will be available for purchase. No ticke
 t needed.\nhttps://www.imagescinema.org/movie/cultural-collab-2\nFrom Push
 pin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.imagescinema.org/movie/cultural-collab-2
END:VEVENT
