SUMMARY:Captain January (1924) w/Leslie McMichael
LOCATION:Images Cinema\, 50 Spring St\, Williamstown\, MA 01267
DESCRIPTION:The adorable antics of Baby Peggy are showcased in the 1924 sil
 ent film hit\, Captain January\, which plays at Images Cinema on Thursday\
 , October 1 st at 7 pm. The restored silent movie will be accompanied live
  by harpist-composer Leslie McMichael and her sister\, violist Barbara McM
 ichael.\nhttps://www.imagescinema.org/movie/captain-january-1924-wleslie-h
 arp\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.imagescinema.org/movie/captain-january-1924-wleslie-harp
END:VEVENT
